  "solutions": [
    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1967-p18.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The inequality \\((x-2)(x-3)\\lt0\\) gives \\(2\\lt x\\lt3.\\) On this interval \\(P=x^2+5x+6\\) is increasing, with endpoint values \\(P(2)=20\\) and \\(P(3)=30.\\) The endpoints are excluded, so \\(20\\lt P\\lt30.\\)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is B.",
